course: dictionary
lesson: 13973
title: Short forms and names: liv
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Liv is not a full English word. It is a short form, cut off from a longer word, or it is a name. When you see it, read the words around it to decide which meaning fits.
explain: Read this advert: «Two bedrooms, big liv rm, garden at the back.» Adverts are about homes, so liv rm must mean living room. The clues tell you which meaning to choose.
explain: Read this story: «Liv was the first to reach the top of the hill.» Liv has a capital letter and it is a person doing things, so Liv is a girl's name. In a sports table, «Liv are top with 40 points» means Liverpool. Always ask: what would fit here?
fact: Liv can mean living, a girl's name, or Liverpool.
fact: «Liv rm» is a short form of living room, used in house adverts and notes.
fact: Liv is a girl's name, short for Olivia, and it is also a Scandinavian name meaning «life».
fact: In sports scores and lists, «Liv» (UK, informal) is a short form of Liverpool.
fact: A capital letter and the words around Liv often show whether it is a name.
exercise: «Big liv rm with a bay window, to let.» What does liv rm mean? | a kitchen garden | a bathroom | *living room
exercise: «Liv will bring her dog to the party.» What is Liv here? | a room in a house | a football team | *a girl's name | a short form of Liverpool
exercise: «In the league table, Liv are top with 40 points.» What does Liv mean here? | a wet day in Scotland | a living room | *Liverpool | a girl's name
test: Viewing Tuesday. Liv rm, two bedrooms, near the park. What does liv mean in this advert? | a bedroom | Liverpool | *living room | a girl's name
test: «Liv scored twice and cheered with her friends.» What is Liv most likely to be? | a football score | Liverpool | *a girl's name | a living room
exam: In a house advert you read «liv rm», in a story you meet «Liv», and in a sports table you see «Liv». Which meaning is right for the advert? | Liverpool | *living room | a girl's name | a football score
